{"sourceUrl":"https://www.nai.edu.cn/info/2721/69631.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:07.511503+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.nai.edu.cn/info/2721/69631.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为</span></span><span><span>增强全国高校优秀大学生对北京国家会计学院的了解，</span></span><span><span>激发对相关学科学习和研究的兴趣，北京国家会计学院将</span></span><span><span>于</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>8<span>月</span></span><span><span>举办</span><span>“202</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>暑期线上研学</span><span><span>活动</span><span>”</span><span>。欢迎</span></span><span>全国各高校优秀学子</span><span><span>积极参与</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>一起相约云上，共同走进北京国家会计学院</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>一、</span><span>学院</span><span>简介</span></p><p><span><span>北京国家会计学院成立于</span> 1998 <span>年 </span><span>7 </span><span>月 </span><span>20 </span><span>日，是财政部所属事业单位。</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>财政部党组的坚强领导和悉心关怀下，学院始终坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，全面贯彻党的教育方针，落实立德树人根本任务</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>作为国内首批开展会计硕士研究生教育工作的单位和</span>AAPEQ<span>认证</span><span>A</span><span>级成员单位，学院坚持把思想政治教育、职业道德培育和专业素养提升有机结合，以质量为纲，锻造形成了独具特色的精品研究生教育品牌。目前，学院设有会计</span><span>(125300)</span><span>、审计</span><span>(</span></span><span>1</span><span>25700)<span>、税务</span><span>(025300)</span><span>、金融（</span><span>025100</span><span>）四个硕士研究生专业学位项目，拥有一支精通理论前沿、具备丰富实务经验的优秀师资队伍。培养过程以职业需求为导向、以实务能力培养为重点、以产学研结合为路径，通过加强案例教学、案例大赛、实验室教学、</span><span>“</span><span>双导师制</span><span>”</span><span>、加强研究生联合培养基地建设等培养渠道和方式，不断强化研究生应用实践能力培养，持续提升研究生培养质量和用人单位满意度。多年来，毕业生就业一直保持良好态势，历年平均就业率为</span><span>9</span></span><span>5</span><span>%<span>。每年约</span><span>60%</span><span>的毕业生留京工作，</span><span>80%</span><span>以上的毕业生就职于国家机关、事业单位、央企总部、各类金融机构及四大会计师事务所等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>近年来，学院在财政部党组的坚强领导下，牢记为党育人、为国育才的初心使命，高质量推动</span><span>“</span><span>中国特色、国际一流</span><span>”</span><span>会计学院建设发展。</span></span><span><span>今后</span></span><span><span>，学院将</span></span><span><span>继续</span></span><span><span>充分发挥学院优势特色，突出</span><span>“</span><span>高质量</span><span>”</span><span>发展定位、</span><span>“</span><span>差异化</span><span>”</span><span>培养特色、</span><span>“</span><span>国家级</span><span>”</span><span>智库标准、</span><span>“</span><span>国际化</span><span>”</span><span>办学模式，朝着</span><span>“</span><span>中国特色、国际一流</span><span>”</span><span>发展目标努力奋进</span></span><span><span>！</span></span></p><p><span>二、</span><span>活动安排</span></p><p><strong><span><span>    举办时间</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>8<span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p>         <strong><span><span>活动内容</span></span></strong><span><span>：</span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.nai.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=RLzC7DU49iU8CZLV4rfMm7anlCZnNV22n7r2MR9PnR9PL7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVLShRLkyDM4lso7LDnz-aLm7ZU8nfUmlPn7lPL4lPUmVFU4N4ozGDMlVFMmUYnR7Jqjfjo4OeoDW/QDXKqjAbgDTJQty0LmvYLSyDozC4LSbw62d8c&amp;oid=2110466537&amp;tid=2721&amp;nid=69631&amp;e=.jpg\" title=\"undefined\"/></p><p><span><span></span></span><br/></p><p><strong><span>三、</span></strong><strong><span><span>奖助体系介绍</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1</span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>奖学金</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>我院硕士研究生的奖学金体系包括国家奖学金、新生奖学金和优秀奖学金。</span></span><span>相关</span><span><span>奖学金评定基本情况</span></span><span>请关注</span><span><span>2027</span><span>年接收推荐免试硕士研究生章程。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2</span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>助学金</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>我院全日制非定向在读研究生可获得每人每月</span>700<span>元的助学金；学生本人或家庭直系亲属罹患重大疾病、遭受严重意外伤害的补助最高可达</span><span>5000</span><span>元。</span></span></p><p><span>四、咨询方式</span></p><p><span><span>电话：（</span>010<span>）</span><span>64505080</span><span>、</span><span>64505170</span><span>、</span><span>64505171</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:yjszs@mail.nai.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yjszs@mail.nai.edu.cn</span></span></a></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"5e4af0d2e56fa92eb8466cf6477335c961d626082e213e89803745f7bf2e05e2","textLength":995,"sourceSha256":"db04c06b2c1f6947881f26d42c6f398081e816602a9a7d020f59bbff120a348c","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a3662217d3fc5f199df7","title":"2026年国家会计学院全校类云聚国会，研启新程——北京国家会计学院2026年暑期线上研学活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:07.511503+00:00"}
